        "id": "s1",
        "title": {
          "en": "The twenty-fifth statue",
          "hi": "पच्चीसवीं प्रतिमा"
        },
        "image": {
          "id": "tad-more-s1",
          "brief": "The twenty-fifth statue holding a pair of stone scales that tilt gently; Dādī pointing at the beam; Śuka perched on one pan which sinks slightly; Lubdhaka's foreman watching the scales hold his breath.",
          "alt": {
            "en": "A statue holds stone scales tilting gently while a parrot perches on one pan",
            "hi": "पत्थर का तराज़ू थामे प्रतिमा, एक पलड़े पर बैठा तोता"
